    <!-- Upload consent and upload -->
    <string name="consent_title">Send your rides to the project?</string>
    <string name="consent_what_is_sent">What is sent</string>
    <string name="consent_agree">Agree</string>
    <string name="consent_not_now">Not now</string>
    <string name="consent_text">Your rides help build a map of how comfortable cycle paths are. If you agree, the app sends each finished ride to the project server when you\'re on Wi-Fi.\n\nWhat is sent: the motion sensor data, the GPS track, sound levels in frequency bands (never audio), your poll answers, the bike type, the phone model and app version, and a random id for this app install. The first and last 150 to 250 m of every ride are cut off, so your home or work isn\'t in the data.\n\nWhat is not sent: your name, contact details, bike names or colours, or the full track you can export as GPX.\n\nThe data is used for research in this project. You can turn automatic upload off at any time, and delete everything this phone sent, under Settings.</string>
